.ie .i mi jinvi la'e zoi superkalafrAj.

Could we step back for a second & appreciate how awesome this is?   
Lojban is misnamed; logic is only one of its corners; a better name  
would be the Everything Language.  Evidentials?  Sure toss them in.    
Tenses or aspects?  Why not both!  Need a word for something?  Make as  
many as you like.  And what if with all its features Lojban still  
doesn't cover what you want to say?  There's the zoi escape hatch!   
Say it in Solresol if you need to!

.superkalafrAj bau la lojban. .iucai fi la lojban. .iucai fo tu'a dei

mu'o mi'e. bret.



